From d32a0779ebf5361fce581cac9f87fbf98e8ee361 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wmehanna <wassimmehanna@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:43:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(27on86): install a boot-time sshd and run SMP guests on
 MTTCG

persist-sshd.py installs an sshd LaunchDaemon from the single-user
shell so a guest can be reached over ssh without Setup Assistant. The
run script uses MTTCG for SMP guests by default and a check script
boots it with a small two-vCPU test image.
